# The worksheet PDFs in private-pdfs/ are intentionally excluded from the
# public static deployment. They are only reachable through api/download.js,
# which is a serverless function bundled with its own copy of these files via
# the "functions" -> "includeFiles" entry in vercel.json. That function only
# returns a file after a successful server-side Loops contact call, so an
# email address has to actually be captured before the PDF is served.
#
# Do not remove this line, and do not re-add these files to the repo root —
# doing either makes every worksheet downloadable with no email required.
private-pdfs/
